WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.720
Hey guys,
Our new merch designs are finally here.&nbsp;

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:09.400
So the only problem is we couldn't&nbsp;
choose on just one so we chose two.&nbsp;

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.680
This is my favorite.
Habakkuk 3.&nbsp;

00:00:11.680 --> 00:00:15.720
And this is the design Nikita loves.
You like yours more than mine?&nbsp;

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.480
Well I like... I like both.
That's why we took both of them.&nbsp;

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.640
Yeah, that's true.
This is just a reminder&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:25.960
for you guys to always remember that you can&nbsp;
never find true peace and joy in this world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:31.240
from temporary materialistic things.
It comes only from God Himself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:35.880
even when you go through trials and&nbsp;
tribulations you only find it in God.&nbsp;

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:41.800
And so He will make your feet like that of a deer.
To tread on high places.&nbsp;

00:00:41.800 --> 00:00:43.000
There we go.
Love you guys,&nbsp;

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:44.960
Get the merch.
Get it for someone out there who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.960 --> 00:00:47.640
you need - who you know might need it.
Love you.&nbsp;

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:48.680
Bye.
Bye.

